/* ============================================================
   SMALL STEPS (v2, Nov 2026): the next moves each state could make
   ------------------------------------------------------------
   Used by the Take Action page (pick a step, send the letter), the
   Atlas state panel ("small steps to level up"), the city pages and
   the social cards. Every step now says who decides, when, which
   bill (if there is one), what it's worth on the leaderboards, and
   who is already working on it.

   STEP_SESSIONS: each legislature's 2027 dates (verified Nov 2026).
   STEP_LEADS: hand-written steps from the Nov 2026 state audit, built
   from the Atlas notes and each state's real bills. Update them with
   atlas-data.js whenever a bill moves.
   Ordering: psychedelic steps lead; each state gets a mix of quick
   wins, bigger lifts and long-game goals; syringe services never lead.
   ============================================================ */
